## Households

Module 1's audit now becomes covenant. Reclaim the Shema's architecture for your home: guard the thresholds (first and last thirty minutes of the day device-free), the table (a screen-free meal as daily liturgy), and the doorframes (chargers live outside bedrooms). Filter what enters by Philippians 4:8 — whatever is true, noble, right, pure, lovely — as the household's content policy.